---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Documents"
  description="Original document transcriptions: German restitution records, ITS summary card, and Polish Jewish registry entry for Herman Freiman."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Documents &amp; Transcriptions</h1>
    <p>Key primary source documents, with original German or Polish text alongside English translations.</p>

    <!-- Ketubah -->
    <h2>Marriage Certificate (Ketubah)</h2>
    <p>The Ketubah — the Jewish marriage contract — of Herman and Ester Freiman, dated 1945. Written in Aramaic using the standard Ashkenazic formula, handwritten on lined paper (typical of wartime and immediate postwar conditions). The document is complete and signed by two witnesses.</p>

    <div class="doc-card">
      <div class="doc-card-head">
        <span class="doc-card-title">Ketubah — כְּתוּבָּה</span>
        <span class="doc-card-date">Shabbat · Hebrew year 5705 · 1945</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-card-body">
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Key Fields (OCR)</span>
            <table class="doc-inner-table">
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>Day</td><td>Shabbat (Saturday) — <span dir="rtl" lang="he">בְּשַׁבָּת</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Hebrew year</td><td>5705 (1944–1945) — <span dir="rtl" lang="he">שנת חמשת אלפים ושבע מאות וחמישה</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Place</td><td><span dir="rtl" lang="he">ואוואסושט</span> — unidentified; Poland, 1945 (see note)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Groom</td><td>Herman Freiman · Hebrew: <span dir="rtl" lang="he">צְבִי הִירְשׁ</span> (Tzvi Hirsch)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Bride</td><td>Ester · Hebrew: <span dir="rtl" lang="he">אֶסְתֵּר</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Mohar</td><td>100 zekukim of refined silver — <span dir="rtl" lang="he">מאה זקוקים כסף צרוף</span> (standard Ashkenazic amount)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Witness 1</td><td><span dir="rtl" lang="he">צבי בן אליעזר זלמן</span> — Tzvi ben Eliezer Zalman</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Witness 2</td><td><span dir="rtl" lang="he">חיים בן אברהם</span> — Chayim ben Avraham</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Language</td><td>Aramaic (standard Ketubah formula)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Closing formula</td><td><span dir="rtl" lang="he">ודבכל שריר וקים</span> — "and all is valid and confirmed"</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Notes</span>
            <p class="doc-text"><strong>Hebrew name:</strong> The Ketubah confirms Herman used the Ashkenazic double name <em>Tzvi Hirsch</em> (צבי הירש) — tzvi (Hebrew: deer/stag) paired with hirsch (its Yiddish equivalent from German). This is the only document in the archive to record his Hebrew name.</p>
            <p class="doc-text"><strong>Place name:</strong> The wedding location is written <span dir="rtl" lang="he">ואוואסושט</span>. Reading right to left (Hebrew direction) gives the phoneme sequence T-SH-O-S-A-W-W-A-W = <em>"Tchosawwaw"</em> — consistent with <strong>Częstochowa</strong> (Yiddish: <em>Tshenstokhov</em>), one of the largest CKŻP (Central Committee of Polish Jews) centres in 1945. In Galician Yiddish — the dialect Herman spoke — two documented sound shifts apply: the nasal "EN" → "O", and the guttural KH weakening to W/V, yielding "Tshosawwaw" from "Tshenstokhov." Częstochowa was a major transit and resettlement hub for Jewish survivors from eastern Galicia in 1945, and rabbinical marriages were actively organised there. Confirmation requires expert paleography of the original handwritten document.</p>
            <p class="doc-text"><strong>Format:</strong> Handwritten on lined paper rather than a pre-printed form — typical of marriages conducted in displaced or transit communities immediately after the war.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="doc-figure doc-figure--ketubah">
          <img src="/photos/Ktuba_of_Herman_and_Esther_Freiman.jpeg" alt="Ketubah of Herman (Tzvi Hirsch) Freiman and Ester, 1945, handwritten in Aramaic" />
          <figcaption>Ketubah of Herman (Tzvi Hirsch) Freiman and Ester, 1945. Handwritten Aramaic on lined paper. Signed by two witnesses: Tzvi ben Eliezer Zalman and Chayim ben Avraham.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Restitution overview -->
    <h2>German Restitution (Wiedergutmachung)</h2>
    <p>After emigrating to Israel, Herman pursued <em>Wiedergutmachung</em> (restitution/reparations) from West Germany for damages suffered during the Nazi persecution.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Restitution File Number</td><td>E.A. Stuttgart 11 672(o)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Attorney</td><td>Dr. Herbert Mannheim, Hajam Rd. 6, Mt. Carmel, Haifa</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Power of Attorney Date</td><td>October 20, 1959</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Certificate Issued</td><td>February 26, 1960 (No. 413381)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Certificates Requested</td><td>Inhaftierungsbescheinigung · Aufenthaltsbescheinigung</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- Document card: Vollmacht -->
    <div class="doc-card">
      <div class="doc-card-head">
        <a class="doc-card-title" href="/docs/its-td-file-790495-certificate-vollmacht.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Power of Attorney (Vollmacht) ↗</a>
        <span class="doc-card-date">October 20, 1959</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-card-body">
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Original German</span>
            <p class="doc-text"><em>Ich, der/die unterzeichnete, Herman Freiman, wohnhaft in Kfar Ata-Giwat Ata/Israel, Hugo Mollerstr. 28, bevollmächtige hiermit Herrn Dr. Herbert Mannheim, Haifa/Israel, Hajam Rd. 6, Mt. Carmel, sämtliche Auskünfte u. Erkundigungen, die sich auf Entschädigungsansprüche wegen Schaden an Leben, Freiheit und Gesundheit für mich u. meine Familienangehörigen beziehen, von dem Internationalen Suchdienst des Roten Kreuzes in Arolsen (Waldeck) einzuziehen.</em></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">English Translation</span>
            <p class="doc-text">I, the undersigned, Herman Freiman, residing at Kfar Ata-Giwat Ata/Israel, Hugo Moller Street 28, hereby authorize Dr. Herbert Mannheim, Haifa/Israel, Hajam Road 6, Mt. Carmel, to obtain all information and inquiries relating to compensation claims for damages to life, liberty, and health for myself and my family members from the International Tracing Service of the Red Cross in Arolsen (Waldeck).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="doc-figure">
          <img src="/photos/Herman_Fraiman_Signature.jpg" alt="Herman Freiman's handwritten signature" />
          <figcaption>Herman Freiman's handwritten signature on the Power of Attorney, October 20, 1959.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Document card: ITS Summary Card -->
    <div class="doc-card">
      <div class="doc-card-head">
        <a class="doc-card-title" href="/docs/its-td-file-790495-certificate-vollmacht.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ITS Summary Card ↗</a>
        <span class="doc-card-date">TD File 790 495</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-card-body">
        <p class="doc-summary">The central record in the Arolsen Archives for Herman Freiman. It summarizes his wartime imprisonment, postwar movements, and emigration.</p>
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Original German</span>
            <p class="doc-text"><em>Name: FREIMAN Herman od. FRAJMAN od. FREIMANN / Eltern: Feibel u. Shifra ROSEN / Geb.: 2.3.1905 in Boryslaw / Nat.: israel./poln. / 7.41-3.44 Gh. u. ZAL Boryslaw / 45-46 Polen / 46-48 DP.Lg.Ulm / 4.11.48 n.Israel m.'Negba' ausgew. / LA.f.Wg.Stgt. dch.Dr.H.Mannheim, Haifa</em></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">English Translation</span>
            <p class="doc-text">Name: FREIMAN Herman or FRAJMAN or FREIMANN / Parents: Feibel and Shifra ROSEN / Born: 2.3.1905 in Boryslaw / Nationality: Israeli/Polish / July 1941–March 1944 Ghetto and Forced Labor Camp Boryslaw / 1945–46 Poland / 1946–48 DP Camp Ulm / November 4, 1948 emigrated to Israel on 'Negba' / State Archive Stuttgart through Dr. H. Mannheim, Haifa</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Document card: Certificate of Residence -->
    <div class="doc-card">
      <div class="doc-card-head">
        <a class="doc-card-title" href="/docs/its-td-file-790495-certificate-vollmacht.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Certificate of Residence — Key Fields ↗</a>
        <span class="doc-card-date">February 26, 1960 · No. 413381</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-card-body">
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Original German</span>
            <p class="doc-text"><em>Über die Inhaftierung liegen keine Unterlagen vor. Abweichung: Geburtsdatum. Faivel = Feibel.</em></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">English Translation</span>
            <p class="doc-text">No documents exist regarding the concentration camp incarceration. Discrepancy: Birth date. Faivel = Feibel [same name — confirming the variants refer to the same person].</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Document card: Polish Registry -->
    <div class="doc-card">
      <div class="doc-card-head">
        <a class="doc-card-title" href="/docs/arolsen-polish-registry-entry.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Polish Jewish Registry Entry ↗</a>
        <span class="doc-card-date">January 1947 · Warsaw</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-card-body">
        <p class="doc-summary">Herman and Ester appeared in the January 1947 alphabetical registry of Polish Jews compiled by the Central Committee of Polish Jews in Warsaw, while living in Bielawa.</p>
        <div class="doc-pair">
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Polish Header</span>
            <p class="doc-text"><em>CENTRALNY KOMITET ŻYDÓW POLSKICH, WARSZAWA, SIENNA 60 — WYKAZ ALFABETYCZNY ŻYDÓW POLSKICH, Lista Nr. 3, Lit. F.</em></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="doc-lang-label">Herman's Entry</span>
            <p class="doc-text">Frajman Herman, 1910, Fajwel, Szyfra Borysław, Bielawa Wolności 131<br /><em>(Name · Birth year · Father · Mother · Hometown · Address)</em></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .doc-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .doc-card-head {
    background: #1a2d4a;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .doc-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c8d8e8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a.doc-card-title:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .doc-card-date {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #7a9aba;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .doc-card-body {
    background: var(--color-parchment);
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .doc-summary {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--color-mid-gray);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .doc-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .doc-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .doc-lang-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }

  .doc-text {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .doc-figure {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .doc-figure img {
    max-width: 320px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .doc-figure figcaption {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-mid-gray);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .doc-figure--ketubah img {
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .doc-inner-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }
  .doc-inner-table td {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .doc-inner-table td:first-child {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding-right: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
</style>
